\label{thm:A08}
Let $G$ be a signed digraph, and let $f$ be a BN on $G$.
\begin{enumerate}
\item If $G$ has no negative cycles, then $f$ has at least one fixed point. 
\item If $G$ has no positive cycles, then $f$ has at most one fixed point. 
\item If $G$ has no negative cycles and no sources, then $f$ has at least two fixed points. 
\item If $G$ has no positive cycles and no sources, then $f$ has no fixed points. 
\end{enumerate}

