\label{pro:positive_G}
Let $G$ be an $n$-vertex signed digraph without negative cycles, and let $f$ be a BN on $G$. The following conditions are equivalent:
\begin{enumerate}
\item
$f$ has a unique fixed point.
\item
$f$ has a synchronizing word of length $n$. 
\item
$f$ is synchronizing.
\end{enumerate}
